    "parts": {
      "when": "[Opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after an enemy unit selects its targets.",
      "target": "A **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit of yours that is a target of at least one of that enemy unit's attacks, and a **DAMNED** unit of yours up to 3\" from it that is [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to both it and the attacking unit.",
      "effect": "Whenever an attack is aimed at your **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit, while your **DAMNED** unit remains on the battlefield, if the attacking model can see your **DAMNED** unit and could target it with that attack, your opponent makes no [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) for it: your **DAMNED** unit instead takes [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) equal to that attack's D, for the rest of the phase."
    },
    "summary": "**When:** [Opponent's Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after an enemy unit selects its targets.\n\n**Target:** A **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit of yours that is a target of at least one of that enemy unit's attacks, and a **DAMNED** unit of yours up to 3\" from it that is [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to both it and the attacking unit.\n\n**Effect:** Whenever an attack is aimed at your **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit, while your **DAMNED** unit remains on the battlefield, if the attacking model can see your **DAMNED** unit and could target it with that attack, your opponent makes no [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) for it: your **DAMNED** unit instead takes [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) equal to that attack's D, for the rest of the phase.",
